      "value": "I have made another canny post regarding this issue, but to keep up the information:  here is a video showcasing that the hands go back to normal in the steamVR menu (at least for me) but do not work in VRChat specifically. You can see my hands popping back and forth between \"working\" and not, based on the menu being opened.\n\nI have spoke to a Pimax employee, they suggested that I update to the newer version of the Pimax software which is unreleased with the app updater and is instead downloaded from their website. The update did not fix this issue.",
