      "value": "People on https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/pimax-hand-tracking-is-broken-in-new-update have reported some workarounds that seem to fix all issues with Pimax for them. Could you try these and report back if there are still problems occuring on VRChat's end? As before, we are unable to reproduce any issues on our end in the general case.\n\nI will also note, just in case, that build 1487 specifically did not contain any changes related to what is described here, so it is more likely that a different software update at the same time or a SteamVR bindings change may have affected this.",
